Day 10 — All 4 Agents Created
1. ResourceOptimizationAgent
What it does: Analyses interviewer workload. Flags overloaded panellists (>15 interviews) and underutilised ones (<3 interviews). Recommends rebalancing.

Files:

workload_calculator.py — pure Python: computes InterviewerLoad per person, WorkloadReport with overloaded/underutilised lists
resource_optimization_agent.py — model_tier="insight", default_collections=["ats_feedback"]
Quick test (no LLM):


.\run.bat scripts\test_day10.py
With LLM:


.\run.bat scripts\test_day10.py --llm
Sample data needed: structured_data["interviewers"] — list of dicts with interviewer_id, name, interviews_assigned, avg_hours_per_interview (optional), avg_rating (optional).

2. OfferInsightsAgent
What it does: Tracks offer acceptance rates per position. Flags positions below 50% acceptance and surfaces salary-related decline patterns.

