3. EvaluationAgent (support tier)
What it does: Runs after all insight agents. Verifies each output for: status == "success", at least 1 insight, confidence_score ≥ 0.5, and RAG evidence. Downgrades confidence scores on flagged outputs and asks the LLM to produce a cross-agent consistency review.

